            "text": "另外 adds another relevant matter or arrangement. Its discourse use introduces an additional point rather than a result.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我要买书，另外还要买笔。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ yào mǎi shū ， lìngwài hái yào mǎi bǐ 。",
